	(text "NOTES:\n\n  - J9 and J11 support 3-wire fans only: \n      pin 1 GND\n      pin 2 independently switched +12 V\n      pin 3 open-collector tach. \n\n  - Q1/Q2 and Q3/Q4 implement high-side supply PWM;\n\nTODO:\n  - [ ] validate PWM, startup, stall, tach, and combined 12 V rail loading\n\n"
